# Named bundles — <bundle-name>|<comma-separated module names>
#
# Pure sugar over repeated `wb add` calls (docs/architecture.md principle 4,
# §10) — `wb install --bundle workstation` is exactly equivalent to one
# `wb add` call per listed name, nothing more. workstation, server and
# minimal mirror the three `dotfiles` profiles for continuity
# (docs/decisions-log.md D35); full is every catalog module (D88).
workstation|git,gpg,ssh,shell
server|git,ssh,shell
minimal|git,ssh
# Every module in modules.list (docs/decisions-log.md D88). Keep in step
# with modules.list — tests/check-bundles-catalog.sh fails if they drift.
full|git,gpg,ssh,shell,cloud,iac,containers,security,ai,desktop,devtools
